name: Link Analysis mobile money
tagline: "A seeded Link Analysis demo for mobile money - 420 wallets, 40 agents, 14 landed days with seven planted stories, staged next-day files, four Demo Users and an index that builds itself"
description: "Vertical A of the multi-vertical Link Analysis showcase (docs/superpower/la-multi-vertical-showcase-plan.md). Three daily or snapshot Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (wallet_txn, wallet_master, agent_master), the mm_links Job folding them into ONE link Dataset (kinds p2p, cash_in, cash_out, merchant_pay, shared_device, shared_id), a masked mm_kyc reference Dataset, three saved views, link-analysis.toon (masking typed, a low four-eyes fan-out threshold of 100, the link index ON, Drafts), la_index_build and la_detect Jobs, Demo Users and roles renamed for the vertical (admin, mm.analyst lead, mm.manager second approver, mm.reviewer read-only, mm.outsider not a member). Planted stories: agent-assisted structuring (25 wallets under the Tier-1 limit through AG-18), a 98 percent pass-through mule chain to cash-out agent AG-39, a nine-wallet device farm, the only directed cycle (four wallets, same amount), a dormant wallet awakening, the benign electricity biller hub MER-ELECTRIC, and a structuring Alert to Case. Investigations, members, Entity Lists, a Case and a bound Alert Rule are runtime state with no template home: run `node tools/seed-la-mm.mjs --apply` against the running server. Staged files in data/staged/wallet_txn are copied into data/inbox/wallet_txn by hand. Regenerate the corpus with tools/gen-la-mm-data.py. Runbook: docs/ops/la-showcase-mm-runbook.md. Needs a Professional or Enterprise edition build with the Link Analysis modules and the Demo Auth build (serve-demo). Synthetic data only."
icon: heroicons_outline:share
contents[8]: "3 Pipelines + schemas (wallet_txn daily, wallet_master, agent_master) with 14 landed days", "Datasets incl. masked mm_kyc reference", "mm_links Job + Dataset", "3 saved views", "link-analysis.toon (masking, four-eyes, index ON, Drafts)", "la_index_build + la_detect Jobs", "4 Demo Users + role table", "Staged next-day and gap-day files"
